✔ a disabled account sees the disabled-account gate, never the protected content (2322.906652ms)
✔ an active account never sees the disabled-account gate (6.284602ms)
✔ legal state still loading shows only a neutral spinner (17.535284ms)
✔ a user without the current acceptance sees the legal form (52.128112ms)
✔ a user who accepted 1.3.0 sees the current-version confirmation before protected content (12.860147ms)
✔ a user who accepted 1.4.0 sees the current-version confirmation; one who accepted the current version goes straight in (12.718366ms)
✔ returning to an open tab checks the legal policy in the background, at most once per interval (29.637453ms)
✔ a legal network error has a specific screen (37.172466ms)
✔ a profile load failure never turns into a legal acceptance request (39.887676ms)
✔ a deletion blocked for financial review shows its own gate, never the generic profile-load error (32.541705ms)
✔ the financial-review gate links to /atendimento, offers a manual sign-out, and never mentions a balance (27.843013ms)
✔ an active account never sees the deletion-blocked gate (14.196916ms)
✔ the deletion gate shows the protocol and progress while the financial review is open (28.8353ms)
✔ once the financial case is separated the gate says the process continues separately and shows the case protocol (27.765508ms)
✔ trigger button renders the same way regardless of how many actions are configured (2117.451516ms)
✔ renders the same trigger with a single action, for future non-edit/delete menus (14.624633ms)
✔ disables the trigger while a row action is pending (21.776515ms)
✔ dialog body shows one tab per AVAILABLE variant, in order, with the first selected (53.748523ms)
✔ "Semana perfeita" tab only exists when the week is 100% done (35.008156ms)
✔ preview is the same SVG that becomes the PNG: an <img> with the data URL and a descriptive alt (31.659943ms)
✔ the status line is a polite live region and starts empty (no stale message) (20.101893ms)
✔ ShareProgressCard renders each variant with its own class (43.650225ms)
✔ consistency card: "Compartilhar" only when the handler exists, alongside the calendar/plan actions (22.030223ms)
✔ consistency card: weekday labels, legend, today status with a period icon (sun or moon) and elegant actions (9.175584ms)
✔ publish mode: same tabs and preview, optional message and "Publicar na comunidade" as the main action (no share/download) (12.445069ms)
✔ publish mode never offers a variant the user has not earned (no "Dia" without a workout, no invalid perfect week) (9.901975ms)
✔ publish mode custom label is supported and the Home mode is unchanged without onPublish (27.421325ms)
✔ the sheet ALWAYS renders a close button in the header (title left, X right), outside the scrollable body, in Home and community modes (14.559315ms)
✔ the primary actions live in the FOOTER (always reachable), not inside the scrolling body (12.604757ms)
✔ Home mode always offers BOTH "Compartilhar" and "Baixar imagem", even without Web Share (no silent download fallback) (17.907738ms)
✔ source contract: "Baixar imagem" only downloads; "Compartilhar" shares files + text (fallback copies + downloads); publishing is separate (42.98782ms)
✔ source contract: the share button can never be stuck busy (every path clears `busy`; spinner only while preparing) (30.665944ms)
✔ Home and community use the SAME sheet base (no Primer Dialog, no divergent implementation) (3.846484ms)
✔ mobile CSS contract: safe-area top/bottom, 100dvh, header/footer outside the scroll area, 44px touch targets, above the app chrome (6.151213ms)
✔ mensagem que cabe: sem animação e rodízio no tempo padrão (7 s) (1032.550077ms)
✔ marca e mensagem ficam separadas: a área rolável tem só a mensagem, e a marca aparece uma vez (6.295208ms)
✔ mensagem longa: uma animação só de transform, e a próxima campanha só entra depois da exibição completa (5.276872ms)
✔ pausa por toque pausa animação e rodízio; ao soltar retoma de onde parou, sem recomeçar (6.292013ms)
✔ aba oculta pausa a rolagem e o rodízio; ao voltar, continua (6.017334ms)
✔ uma só campanha: rolagem em laço, sem contador e sem timer de rodízio (5.453645ms)
✔ prefers-reduced-motion: sem animação nem rodízio automático; texto longo vira região rolável (3.061596ms)
✔ reduced motion com texto que cabe: sem região rolável, sem foco extra (1.515926ms)
